# 历史 tier 占位 — knowledge/historical/

Phase 2 plan 02-02: the historical tier is intentionally empty.
Documents added here would carry tier=历史 metadata when indexed by
plan 02-03's Indexer.

The directory is kept in git (via this .gitkeep) so a fresh clone
preserves the four-tier directory structure that D-07 + D2-12 mandate.